"P862091120" ""Someone really important was killed, Ambassador Maurer. Yeah, rough, I know. It gets worse. The potential suspects are... uncommon, dangerous oh and deadly.<br><br>You see, we can't narrow down the suspect list anymore than we already have without potent"
// AcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P4213176896" ""Excellent. Well, I'll tell you what we know...<br><br><i>riffles through notes...</i><br><br>...Not much. We know who died, we just don't know how he died... where he died... oh and we don't know who exactly killed him. We've gotten the method, the locat"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1338917128" "<color deepskyblue>Investigate the Murder of <br>Ambassador Maurer</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1016945072" ""Yeah, remember when I said we didn't know much about the crime... I was lying.<br><br>We really don't know anything about the crime. I blame the cut backs and the damn aliens - freakin' Rikti... Anyway, you're just going to have to go and investigate the"
// TaskTitle :
"P4181567274" "<color deepskyblue>Investigate the Murder of Ambassador Maurer</color>"

